<div class="Story">
    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">The components of a bundle, under its line</h4>
        <p class="Story-note">
            Printed under the line of a bundle in the cart and under its card on an order: a title and a
            quantity for one bundle, no price and no control, since the price of the pack is the one of the
            line above. The quantity of the line itself is printed by the line.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--roomy">
            <twig:Molecules:BundleIncluded:Base :components="[
                {title: 'Mountain bike', quantity: '1'},
                {title: 'Helmet', quantity: '2'},
                {title: 'Chain lock', quantity: '1'},
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">No component: nothing at all</h4>
        <p class="Story-note">A line that is not a bundle carries no list, and the molecule leaves no empty heading behind.</p>
        <div class="Story-stage"><twig:Molecules:BundleIncluded:Base :components="[]" /></div>
    </div>
</div>
